@host = http://localhost:5042

### 1. Listar usuários (paginado + filtro por nome)
GET {{host}}/api/users?page=1&quantity=10&query=

### 2. Criar usuário  -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria Silva",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "profile": "Operator"
}

### 3. Buscar por id  (troque pelo id retornado no passo 2)
GET {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 4. Atualizar  -> 204 No Content
PUT {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Maria S. Souza",
  "email": "maria@exemplo.com",
  "profile": "Admin"
}

### 5. Remover  -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{host}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 6. Erro de validação -> 400 (ValidationProblemDetails)
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "email": "invalido", "password": "123", "profile": "Admin" }
